<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/8f3c0598-7db6-4e22-b73a-84d9ebf2e2b9-01/SelectionCriterion$_ContractNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot1_TenderingTerms1_UBLExtensions1_UBLExtension1_ExtensionContent1_EformsExtension1_SelectionCriteria1>
  a epo:SelectionCriterion;
  epo:hasSelectionCriterionType <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/selection-criterion/slc-abil-staff-yrly-avg-mp>;
  epo:isUsedForCandidateRestriction true;
  dct:description "To participate in the Tender, it is a minimum requirement that the Tenderer must have a minimum of two (2) qualified lawyers on the Roll of Solicitors or the Roll of Practising Barristers in the Republic of Ireland as at the first Tender Deadline who each have at least five (5) years experience of specialising in general commercial conveyancing and real estate law (including but not limited to land registration, folio searching/title review/reporting and understanding of land tax implications)"@en .

<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/8f3c0598-7db6-4e22-b73a-84d9ebf2e2b9-01/SelectionCriterion$_ContractNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot1_TenderingTerms1_UBLExtensions1_UBLExtension1_ExtensionContent1_EformsExtension1_SelectionCriteria2>
  a epo:SelectionCriterion;
  epo:hasSelectionCriterionType <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/selection-criterion/slc-abil-ref-services>;
  epo:isUsedForCandidateRestriction true;
  dct:description "To participate in the Tender, it is a minimum requirement that the Tenderer as a firm must have acted (in the last two (2) calendar years prior to the first Tender Deadline) for one or more renewable energy companies (including but not limited to large scale utility companies, international renewable energy developers, local and national renewable developers and/or green development funds) on the “developer” and/or “tenant” side on at least five (5) real ­estate transactions in the context of onshore renewable projects (wind, solar, and battery energy storage systems). For the purposes of this experience, multiple transactions and/or agreements within the same re­newable energy project/scheme shall each be considered as individual transactions (for example, two option agreements/lease agreements in respect of the same project would be considered as two separate transac­tions)"@en .

<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/8f3c0598-7db6-4e22-b73a-84d9ebf2e2b9-01/SelectionCriterion$_ContractNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot1_TenderingTerms1_UBLExtensions1_UBLExtension1_ExtensionContent1_EformsExtension1_SelectionCriteria3>
  a epo:SelectionCriterion;
  epo:hasSelectionCriterionType <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/selection-criterion/slc-abil-ref-services>;
  epo:isUsedForCandidateRestriction true;
  dct:description "To participate in the Tender, it is a minimum requirement that the Tenderer as a firm must have acted (in the last two (2) calendar years prior to the first Tender Deadline) in at least ten (10) commercial real estate transactions involving third ­party financing (including but not limited to any mortgage, bank financing, loan agreements and/or project financing)."@en .

<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/8f3c0598-7db6-4e22-b73a-84d9ebf2e2b9-01/SubmissionTerm$_ContractNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot1>
